$AC$ is a diameter of a circle with centre $O$ and radius $6.5$ cm. $B$ lies on the circle and $AB=12$ cm.
(a) Find $BC$.
(b) In a separate circle, $AC$ is a diameter and $\angle BAC=42^{\circ}$. Find $\angle BCA$.
[tikz]\begin{tikzpicture}[draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
